  questionText:
  - language: English
    text: Which of the following statements about enantiomers is correct?
  - language: German
    text: "Welche der folgenden Aussagen \xFCber Enantiomere ist richtig?"
  answers:
  - texts:
    - language: English
      text: Enantiomers have different molecular formulas.
    - language: German
      text: Enantiomere haben unterschiedliche Summenformeln.
  - texts:
    - language: English
      text: Enantiomers differ in all physical properties.
    - language: German
      text: Enantiomere unterscheiden sich in allen physikalischen Eigenschaften.
  - texts:
    - language: English
      text: Enantiomers rotate the plane of polarized light in opposite directions
    - language: German
      text: Enantiomere drehen die Ebene von polarisiertem Licht in entgegengesetzte
        Richtungen.
  - texts:
    - language: English
      text: Enantiomers always react differently with non-chiral compounds.
    - language: German
      text: Enantiomere reagieren immer unterschiedlich mit achiralen Reagenzien.
  correctAnswer: 4
